3. Plugin exception does not apply
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Concat's plugin exception covers Independent Modules that talk through the
Concat API / IPC / project format without vendoring or modifying Concat
source. CtrlBeat is a full-app product fork. That exception does not apply.
You cannot treat CtrlBeat as a plugin in order to use a more permissive
license for the whole editor.

